<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Kohtetsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Kohtetsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.78		vs	    5.41</p>
<p> Operating    loss 68 million	 vs   loss 494 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 324 million	 vs   loss 563 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 468 million	 vs   loss 593 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 26.88 yen	  vs    loss 34.02 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Kohtetsu Co Ltd is a manufacturer of angle steel and billets.</p>
</text>
